    {
      "type": "text",
      "id": "tool_annot",
      "x": 150,
      "y": 812,
      "width": 1600,
      "height": 36,
      "text": "annotations are the routing logic:  create destructive:false  \u00b7  run destructive:false (it cannot harm the host)  \u00b7  destroy destructive:TRUE, idempotent:true\nresults are ALWAYS structured \u2014 an unexpected backend exception still reaches the agent as {stdout, stderr, exit_code, success}, never as a crashed call",
      "originalText": "annotations are the routing logic:  create destructive:false  \u00b7  run destructive:false (it cannot harm the host)  \u00b7  destroy destructive:TRUE, idempotent:true\nresults are ALWAYS structured \u2014 an unexpected backend exception still reaches the agent as {stdout, stderr, exit_code, success}, never as a crashed call",
      "fontSize": 12,
      "fontFamily": 3,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "strokeColor": "#64748b",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
