      "text": "sandbox_ops.py \u2014 the judgement calls, shared by BOTH runtimes\nassert_policy_applied \u00b7 seal / unseal \u00b7 collect_orphans \u00b7 too_young\nwritten once, so one test suite covers both implementations",
