    {
      "type": "text",
      "id": "rest_notes",
      "x": 150,
      "y": 1916,
      "width": 1000,
      "height": 60,
      "text": "negotiation:  GET /version  ->  choose min(preferred 1.44, ApiVersion)  ->  CONFIRM with GET /v1.44/_ping\nidentify():   names the PRODUCT, not the pipe \u2014 Podman commonly serves docker_engine on Windows\nscope:        only NativeRuntime uses rest/; the legacy runtime reaches the engine via llm_sandbox",
      "originalText": "negotiation:  GET /version  ->  choose min(preferred 1.44, ApiVersion)  ->  CONFIRM with GET /v1.44/_ping\nidentify():   names the PRODUCT, not the pipe \u2014 Podman commonly serves docker_engine on Windows\nscope:        only NativeRuntime uses rest/; the legacy runtime reaches the engine via llm_sandbox",
      "fontSize": 12,
