    {
      "type": "text",
      "id": "endp_notes",
      "x": 1660,
      "y": 1796,
      "width": 620,
      "height": 195,
      "text": "the limits and both labels, in one HostConfig\n\nread the limits BACK off the real container\nreturns an exec id\nhijacked stream, 8-byte multiplexed frames\nExitCode  \u00b7  is it still Running?\na tar body \u2014 code never passes through a shell\nTHE SEAL: detach every attached network\nre-attached only to install packages\nchunked JSON stream of pull progress\nhow GC finds our containers, by label\nforce remove",
      "originalText": "the limits and both labels, in one HostConfig\n\nread the limits BACK off the real container\nreturns an exec id\nhijacked stream, 8-byte multiplexed frames\nExitCode  \u00b7  is it still Running?\na tar body \u2014 code never passes through a shell\nTHE SEAL: detach every attached network\nre-attached only to install packages\nchunked JSON stream of pull progress\nhow GC finds our containers, by label\nforce remove",
      "fontSize": 13,
      "fontFamily": 3,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "strokeColor": "#93c5fd",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
