    {
      "type": "text",
      "id": "ctr_fs",
      "x": 580,
      "y": 2336,
      "width": 580,
      "height": 110,
      "text": "/sandbox   submitted code lands here, written as a tar\n           NOT a tmpfs: the archive API cannot write\n           through one on Docker \u2014 it 200s and does nothing\n/work      tmpfs, 64m, counted against the memory limit,\n           discarded with the container\n/tmp       writable, but not separately size-limited",
      "originalText": "/sandbox   submitted code lands here, written as a tar\n           NOT a tmpfs: the archive API cannot write\n           through one on Docker \u2014 it 200s and does nothing\n/work      tmpfs, 64m, counted against the memory limit,\n           discarded with the container\n/tmp       writable, but not separately size-limited",
      "fontSize": 12,
      "fontFamily": 3,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "strokeColor": "#374151",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
