    {
      "type": "text",
      "id": "gc_b3",
      "x": 2560,
      "y": 1020,
      "width": 790,
      "height": 205,
      "text": "runtime.gc(registry.known_ids())\n  the snapshot is taken AFTER passes 1 and 2, so a sandbox created\n  during the sweep is already known; reservations count as known too\n\nGET /v1.44/containers/json?filters={\"label\":[\"hyperbox-mcp.managed=true\"]}\nfor each container it returns:\n  sandbox_id = labels[\"hyperbox-mcp.id\"]\n  if sandbox_id in known_ids     -> skip\n  if too_young(container)        -> skip   (created less than 120s ago)\n  DELETE /v1.44/containers/{id}?force=true\n\nbest effort by design: an engine that is not installed or not running is\nskipped, never fatal \u2014 GC must never stop the server from serving.",
      "originalText": "runtime.gc(registry.known_ids())\n  the snapshot is taken AFTER passes 1 and 2, so a sandbox created\n  during the sweep is already known; reservations count as known too\n\nGET /v1.44/containers/json?filters={\"label\":[\"hyperbox-mcp.managed=true\"]}\nfor each container it returns:\n  sandbox_id = labels[\"hyperbox-mcp.id\"]\n  if sandbox_id in known_ids     -> skip\n  if too_young(container)        -> skip   (created less than 120s ago)\n  DELETE /v1.44/containers/{id}?force=true\n\nbest effort by design: an engine that is not installed or not running is\nskipped, never fatal \u2014 GC must never stop the server from serving.",
      "fontSize": 12,
      "fontFamily": 3,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "strokeColor": "#64748b",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 1,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
