    {
      "type": "text",
      "id": "tp_body",
      "x": 2490,
      "y": 1300,
      "width": 850,
      "height": 54,
      "text": "An MCP client restarts its servers freely and may run several at once \u2014 two\neditors open means two processes. Ownership lives in the registry rather than\nin either process's memory, so a new process reattaches by container_ref.",
      "originalText": "An MCP client restarts its servers freely and may run several at once \u2014 two\neditors open means two processes. Ownership lives in the registry rather than\nin either process's memory, so a new process reattaches by container_ref.",
